The Hennessey Venom F5 was first revealed in August 2014.<ref>{{cite web |title=Incredibly Sexy Hennessey Venom F5 Has Its Sight Set On 290MPH |url=https://mikeshouts.com/hennessey-venom-f5/ |website=Mikeshouts |date=August 6, 2014 |publisher=Mike Chua}}</ref> Subsequently, it was shown as an exterior mock-up at the American [[SEMA (association)|SEMA Show]] in [[Las Vegas]] on November 1, 2017. This concept model had three exhausts and active aero, which was later changed. This model did not contain an engine or an interior.<ref>{{cite AV media |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XDDD8w01YHw |title=Hennessey Venom F5 First Look, 1,600 HP! {{!}} 2017 SEMA Show |publisher=AutoGuide |location=US |date=2017-11-02 |access-date=2019-10-30 |via=YouTube}}</ref>

